{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：10:02 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"天盛苑。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/f02a837402dd26d8636f04d097d38452/2026-10/page_157.jpg\"/>\n<p>天水圍有人墮樓死亡。今日（21日）早上8時07分，天盛苑盛珍閣一名女子墮樓，倒臥在大廈對開行人路上，保安員報案。救護員趕至，惜女事主已當場死亡。警方正調查死者身份及事故原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T02:20:31.812546+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:02:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T06:18:01.776126+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T02:18:10.251908+00:00","content_hash":"ec7e7d219247f0a80ebea5821d732d092481112d9cc06157ce119b0be5a0b9fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}